    "talks": [
        {
            "id": "45201",
            "objective": "Find Amber and ask about the boy from Wolvendom",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "4520101",
                    "speaker": "Amber",
                    "text": "#Hi Paimon, hi {NICKNAME}! What can I do for you?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "4520102",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Hi Amber~",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "4520103",
                            "text": "Amber, something has come up...",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "4520104",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Amber, do you know a wolf boy from Wolvendom?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "4520105",
                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                    "text": "Who?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "4520106",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "He said you guys hit it off like a mountain on fire..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "4520107",
                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                    "text": "What on earth are you talking about?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "4520108",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Strange... He said he would wait for you at your regular spot. Did you lose your memory or something?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "4520109",
                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                    "text": "My memory is fine. But you've been eating magic matsutake again, haven't you Paimon?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "4520110",
                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                    "text": "I have no idea what you're talking about."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "4520111",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Magic matsutake... Remind me what color they are?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "4520112",
                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                    "text": "Purple."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "4520113",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "...Paimon may have had a couple the other day."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "4520114",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "But that's not the point! Paimon's not loopy!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "4520115",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Do you really not know that boy that lives with the wolves?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "4520116",
                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                    "text": "I. don't. know. what. you're. talking. about."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "4520117",
                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                    "text": "But on the subject of wolves, I've been investigating something recently."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "4520118",
                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                    "text": "In the past, the wolves never dared venture outside of Wolvendom. But now they're getting braver."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "4520119",
                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                    "text": "I heard they attacked a cart fleet near Drunkard Gorge."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "4520120",
                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                    "text": "If you have time, could you come and check out the situation with me?",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "4520121",
                                            "text": "Sure.",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "4520123",
                                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                                    "text": "Awesome! I knew I could count on you, let's go."
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "4520122",
                                            "text": "Let's get to it."
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "4520124",
                            "text": "Hey Amber, what's up?",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "4520125",
                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                    "text": "Hi... Looks like you've got a bit of time on your hands."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "4520126",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Uh-oh, here it comes..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "4520127",
                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                    "text": "I've been rushed off my feet recently. An Outrider's duties never end, so... Wanna help?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "4520129",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Told you so!",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "4520130",
                                            "text": "Sure.",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "4520132",
                                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                                    "text": "Recently, wolves have been attacking the carts at Drunkard Gorge."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "4520133",
                                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                                    "text": "As you know, wolves are dangerous, but they do have their own rules."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "4520134",
                                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                                    "text": "Mondstadt's wolves don't normally venture outside of the Brightcrown Mountains and Wolvendom."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "4520135",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Yes, Paimon heard someone say that those areas do have their own set of rules, even though they are wild and untouched by humans."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "4520136",
                                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                                    "text": "That's right. So for wolves to be showing up around Drunkard Gorge is very unusual."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "4520137",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Speaking of wolves, do you happen to know a wolf boy from Wolvendom?"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "4520138",
                                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                                    "text": "Who? I've never heard of anyone like that around Mondstadt."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "4520139",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Um... What?"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "4520140",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "\"The red one, burny girl...\" That ain't you?"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "4520141",
                                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                                    "text": "Burny...? What are you talking about?"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "4520142",
                                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                                    "text": "Anyway, I'm off to Drunkard Gorge to investigate."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "4520143",
                                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                                    "text": "Come with me!"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "4520131",
                                            "text": "What's the issue?"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "45202",
            "objective": "Go to Drunkard Gorge",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "4520201",
                    "speaker": "Amber",
                    "text": "Look, up ahead! Something's happening."
                },
                {
                    "id": "4520202",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "That ain't no wolf pack... looks like it's the hilichurls attacking the carts after all."
                },
                {
                    "id": "4520203",
                    "speaker": "Amber",
                    "text": "Huh. Not such a mystery after all."
                },
                {
                    "id": "4520204",
                    "speaker": "Amber",
                    "text": "Enough talk. Let's go help out!"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "45203",
            "objective": "Talk to Amber about the disturbance up ahead",
            "dialogues": []
        },
        {
            "id": "45206",
            "objective": "Defeat the hilichurls",
            "dialogues": []
        },
        {
            "id": "45204",
            "objective": "Defeat the hilichurls",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "4520401",
                    "speaker": "Amber",
                    "text": "Quick, let's go help!"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "45205",
            "objective": "Talk to Siegfria",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "4520301",
                    "speaker": "Siegfria",
                    "text": "Bless you!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "4520302",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Piece of cake!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "4520303",
                    "speaker": "Amber",
                    "text": "So, the hilichurls have been starting to flex their muscles on the back of the wolf scare."
                },
                {
                    "id": "4520304",
                    "speaker": "Siegfria",
                    "text": "That's right. But I must say, if you think the Hilichurls are a nasty lot, the wolves are even worse."
                },
                {
                    "id": "4520305",
                    "speaker": "Siegfria",
                    "text": "They... they attacked Springvale this morning."
                },
                {
                    "id": "4520306",
                    "speaker": "Amber",
                    "text": "Springvale!? That's crazy!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "4520307",
                    "speaker": "Siegfria",
                    "text": "It's unheard of."
                },
                {
                    "id": "4520308",
                    "speaker": "Siegfria",
                    "text": "I thought I would take my chances on the road after the wolves had their fun... I never thought the hilichurls would show up too."
                },
                {
                    "id": "4520309",
                    "speaker": "Amber",
                    "text": "We should head there soon and see how bad the situation is."
                },
                {
                    "id": "4520310",
                    "speaker": "Amber",
                    "text": "But first things first, you should assess the damage to your cart. Does it still work?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "4520311",
                    "speaker": "Siegfria",
                    "text": "I'll take a look."
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}